<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>1</b></sup> I will extol thee, my God, O king; and I will bless thy name for ever and ever.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>2</b></sup> Every day will I bless thee; and I will praise thy name for ever and ever.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>3</b></sup> Great <i>is</i> the LORD, and greatly to be praised; and his greatness <i>is</i> unsearchable.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>4</b></sup> One generation shall praise thy works to another, and shall declare thy mighty acts.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>5</b></sup> I will speak of the glorious honour of thy majesty, and of thy wondrous works.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>6</b></sup> And <i>men</i> shall speak of the might of thy terrible acts: and I will declare thy greatness.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>7</b></sup> They shall abundantly utter the memory of thy great goodness, and shall sing of thy righteousness.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>8</b></sup> The LORD <i>is</i> gracious, and full of compassion; slow to anger, and of great mercy.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>9</b></sup> The LORD <i>is</i> good to all: and his tender mercies <i>are</i> over all his works.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>10</b></sup> All thy works shall praise thee, O LORD; and thy saints shall bless thee.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>11</b></sup> They shall speak of the glory of thy kingdom, and talk of thy power;<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>12</b></sup> To make known to the sons of men his mighty acts, and the glorious majesty of his kingdom.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>13</b></sup> Thy kingdom <i>is</i> an everlasting kingdom, and thy dominion <i>endureth</i> throughout all generations.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>14</b></sup> The LORD upholdeth all that fall, and raiseth up all <i>those that be</i> bowed down.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>15</b></sup> The eyes of all wait upon thee; and thou givest them their meat in due season.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>16</b></sup> Thou openest thine hand, and satisfiest the desire of every living thing.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>17</b></sup> The LORD <i>is</i> righteous in all his ways, and holy in all his works.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>18</b></sup> The LORD <i>is</i> nigh unto all them that call upon him, to all that call upon him in truth.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>19</b></sup> He will fulfil the desire of them that fear him: he also will hear their cry, and will save them.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>20</b></sup> The LORD preserveth all them that love him: but all the wicked will he destroy.<br />
<title canonical="true" type="psalm">David’s <i>Psalm</i> of praise.</title><sup><b>21</b></sup> My mouth shall speak the praise of the LORD: and let all flesh bless his holy name for ever and ever. <br />
